{"diagnosis": "Fetch makes no progress with max_addr=0x00000000 vs expected advancing fetches through 256-word NOP mem. Both reg_pc and reg_next_pc latch current_pc so PC sticks at 0. Root cause is lines 1526-1527 where reg_next_pc <= current_pc omits the +2/+4 increment selected by compressed_instr.", "patch_diff": "diff --git a/picorv32.v b/picorv32.v
--- a/picorv32.v
+++ b/picorv32.v
@@ -1526,2 +1526,2 @@
 				reg_pc <= current_pc;
-				reg_next_pc <= current_pc;
+				reg_next_pc <= current_pc + (compressed_instr ? 2 : 4);
", "expected": "tohost PASS (not FAIL 0xdead), max_addr advancing beyond 0x0 with fetch progress"}

